#: kded/engine/backends/cryfs/cryfsbackend.cpp:132
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"This vault was created with an older version of cryfs and needs to be "
"upgraded.\n"
"\n"
"Mind that this process is irreversible and the vault will no longer work "
"with older versions of cryfs.\n"
"\n"
"Do you want to perform the upgrade now?"
msgstr "Ovaj je trezor stvoren starijom verzijom programa cryfs i potrebno ga je nadograditi.\n\nImajte na umu da je ovaj postupak nepovratan i da trezor više neće raditi sa starijim verzijama programa cryfs.\n\nŽelite li sada nadograditi trezor?"

#: kded/engine/backends/cryfs/cryfsbackend.cpp:136
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"The vault needs to be upgraded before it can be unlocked with this version "
"of cryfs"
msgstr "Trezor je potrebno nadograditi prije otključavanja ovom verzijom programa cryfs"

